# UI verification

Before completing UI work:

1. Run `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm test`, and `pnpm build`.
2. Verify affected flows at 390×844 and 1280×800 in a real browser.
3. Test immediately below and above every changed responsive breakpoint.
4. Exercise changed controls with keyboard and touch-sized targets.
5. Check light and dark themes, sticky positioning, and page-level overflow.
6. Confirm no information or functionality present before the change was removed.
7. Report exact routes and viewports tested; do not claim mobile verification
   without completing the 390px-width pass.
